        "license": "CC BY-SA4.0; viewed only",
        "observations": "Actually inspected complete photograph: roofless ashlar cella; six smooth porch columns with leafy Corinthian capitals and mid-shaft projecting brackets; surviving heavy upper beams/cornice; gated rectangular doorway; side window framed by pilasters and pediment; irregular basal stones, shallow stepped approach and scattered fallen blocks/drums. Golden light is not baked into the neutral warm sandstone."
      },
