        "license": "CC0-1.0; viewed only",
        "observations": "Actually inspected complete complementary north-side picture: open porch on image-left, three attached pilaster divisions on side cella wall, open rectangular window high in that wall with triangular stone surround, no complete roof/pediment above horizontal cornice, broken short courtyard shafts and large loose basal blocks. People/motorcycle omitted."
      }
